---
---

<div class="w-full rounded-2xl bg-[#14221f] text-[#edf4ec] border border-[var(--border)] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-center">
    {/* Left Column: Title & Kicker */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-1">
      <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#c8f169] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
        What I care about
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
        Useful engineering, end to end.
      </h3>
    </div>

    {/* Right Column: 3 Pillars */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#c2cec3] leading-relaxed">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#c8f169] shrink-0 mt-1" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M4 12h16M12 4l8 8-8 8" />
        </svg>
        <span>Systems that stay reliable under real industrial &amp; edge constraints</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#c8f169] shrink-0 mt-1" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18M5.6 5.6l12.8 12.8M18.4 5.6 5.6 18.4" />
        </svg>
        <span>Applied AI that helps people reason with complex technical documentation</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#c8f169] shrink-0 mt-1" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" />
          <rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" />
          <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" />
          <rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" />
        </svg>
        <span>High-ergonomic tools that make developers and engineering teams effective</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
